        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "The " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "mayor", "ref": "v-mayor" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " stood before " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "Groundhog", "zh": "土拨鼠" },
          { "t": "text", "v": "’s door. He heard a little " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "snore", "zh": "打鼾声" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ". “Groundhog, you’re sleeping late,” he said. “It’s Groundhog Day. Please come out!”" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "“I won’t come out!” Groundhog said. “I’m in my bed, and my eyes are still closed.” “I know what we can do!” a little girl said. “Let’s give him breakfast in bed!” They " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "served", "zh": "提供" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " him coffee and bread. Groundhog " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "poured", "ref": "v-pour" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " some coffee from the " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "pot", "zh": "壶" },
          { "t": "text", "v": ". “This coffee is good. It’s nice and hot.”" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "The people in town shouted, “It’s Groundhog Day. Please come out!” “I won’t come out!” Groundhog said. “It’s nice and warm in my bed.” A boy said, “Get him " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "slippers", "ref": "v-slipper" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " to wear! His bedroom floor is cold in there.”" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "Groundhog had never worn slippers before! He did a " },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "jig", "zh": "吉格舞；快步舞" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " all the way to the door and went outside. “Look at me!” he said. “" },
          { "t": "gloss", "v": "Hooray", "zh": "好极了" },
          { "t": "text", "v": "!” said the mayor. “No " },
          { "t": "vocab", "v": "shadow", "ref": "v-shadow" },
          { "t": "text", "v": " today! The cold weather is going away!”" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          { "t": "text", "v": "Groundhog had so much fun with the kids! They made a snowman, round and fat. It looked very nice in the mayor’s hat." }
        ]
      }
    ],
